---
layout: layouts/card.njk
title: Business card
permalink: /card/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{# Two 85x55mm pages: front then back. Printed as a PDF this gives a printer
   exactly what they ask for — one page per side, finished size, no bleed. #}

<div class="card card-front">
  <div>
    <img class="card-logo" src="/assets/logo@3x.png" alt="{{ site.name }}" />
    <p class="card-strap">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <p class="card-name">Darren Pilkington</p>
    <p class="card-role">IT engineer · {{ site.areas | join(" · ") }}</p>
  </div>

  <p class="card-contact">
    <span class="site">{{ site.url | replace("https://", "") }}</span>
    <strong>{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</strong> — call or WhatsApp<br />
    {{ site.email }}
  </p>
</div>

<div class="card card-back">
  <h2>Whatever your IT problem,<br />we'll sort it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Computers, phones, Wi-Fi, printers, email</li>
    <li>Homes and small businesses</li>
    <li>Fixed prices · No fix, no fee</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="promise">Plain English, always · Trading since 2008</p>
</div>
